  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "gv-831794-b00001",
      "text": "US President Donald Trump’s “liberation day” tariffs seem like a late April Fools’ joke for people down under. Norfolk Island, an Australian external territory, has been hit with a 29 percent tariff, even though the tiny island, with a population of approximately 2,000 people, has no exports to the USA.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "body_start": 0,
      "body_end": 304,
      "source_links": [
        "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Norfolk_Island",
        "https://www.sbs.com.au/news/article/see-the-full-list-trumps-liberation-day-tariffs-and-what-they-mean/4ou0556bf"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-831794-b00002",
      "text": "This Reuters YouTube video has a quick summary:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "body_start": 306,
      "body_end": 353,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-831794-b00003",
      "text": "What it does have is a lot of Norfolk pine trees.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 3,
      "body_start": 355,
      "body_end": 404,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-831794-b00004",
      "text": "These are a major part of the picturesque scenery that makes it a key tourist destination. In fact tourism is its main industry.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 4,
      "body_start": 406,
      "body_end": 534,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-831794-b00005",
      "text": "It is also known for its lack of crime, boasting just one murder in the last 150 years in 2002. It had been a British penal settlement until 1855.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 5,
      "body_start": 536,
      "body_end": 682,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-831794-b00006",
      "text": "Seems it was a terrible case of mistaken identity, if posts on BlueSky are accurate:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 6,
      "body_start": 684,
      "body_end": 768,
      "source_links": [
        "https://bsky.app/search?q=norfolk%20island"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-831794-b00007",
      "text": "> We've solved the mystery on why all those remote and uninhabited islands were targeted for tariffs by Trump – they show up in US trade data due to mislabelled shipments. eg mixing up Norfolk, Virginia or Norfolk UK with Norfolk Island!",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 7,
      "body_start": 770,
      "body_end": 1007,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-831794-b00008",
      "text": "> www.theguardian.com/australia-ne…",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 8,
      "body_start": 1009,
      "body_end": 1044,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-831794-b00009",
      "text": "> [image or embed]",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 9,
      "body_start": 1046,
      "body_end": 1064,
      "source_links": [
        "https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:aqhwwfpnptoy4saleaxc7w2c/post/3llxhasztu22l?ref_src=embed"
      ],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-831794-b00010",
      "text": "> — Nick Evershed!? (@nickevershed.bsky.social) April 4, 2025 at 2:15 PM",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 10,
      "body_start": 1066,
      "body_end": 1138,
      "source_links": [
        "https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:aqhwwfpnptoy4saleaxc7w2c/post/3llxhasztu22l?ref_src=embed",
        "https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:aqhwwfpnptoy4saleaxc7w2c?ref_src=embed"
      ],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-831794-b00011",
      "text": "The Heard and McDonald islands, an external Australian territory which is uninhabited except for penguins and other wildlife and can only be reached through a two-week sea voyage, faced a similar fate and was slapped with a 10 percent tariff.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 11,
      "body_start": 1140,
      "body_end": 1382,
      "source_links": [
        "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heard_Island_and_McDonald_Islands"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-831794-b00012",
      "text": "> Donald Trump just put a 10 percent tariff on the Heard Island and McDonald, which has a population of zero people and is inhabited only by penguins.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 12,
      "body_start": 1384,
      "body_end": 1534,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-831794-b00013",
      "text": "> [image or embed]",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 13,
      "body_start": 1536,
      "body_end": 1554,
      "source_links": [
        "https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:f7pgoy3mor2635sjc7ka6qsa/post/3lluhqy5iek2h?ref_src=embed"
      ],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-831794-b00014",
      "text": "> — Shannon Watts (@shannonrwatts.bsky.social) April 3, 2025 at 9:46 AM",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 14,
      "body_start": 1556,
      "body_end": 1627,
      "source_links": [
        "https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:f7pgoy3mor2635sjc7ka6qsa/post/3lluhqy5iek2h?ref_src=embed",
        "https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:f7pgoy3mor2635sjc7ka6qsa?ref_src=embed"
      ],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-831794-b00015",
      "text": "LostNotDamned took a light-hearted approach to the news on a popular Reddit post, referencing Trump's Diversity, equity, and inclusion phobia:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 15,
      "body_start": 1629,
      "body_end": 1771,
      "source_links": [
        "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Executive_Order_14151",
        "https://www.reddit.com/r/MeidasTouch/comments/1jq2s7e/comment/ml3zbdm/"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-831794-b00016",
      "text": "> Let's just hope they're hard working and not some woke DEI penguins!!",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 16,
      "body_start": 1773,
      "body_end": 1844,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-831794-b00017",
      "text": "Perhaps the President had read Global Voices’ story from 2023: “Gay penguin parenthood stories ruffle some conservative feathers.”",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 17,
      "body_start": 1846,
      "body_end": 1976,
      "source_links": [
        "https://globalvoices.org/2023/07/05/gay-penguin-parenthood-stories-ruffle-some-conservative-feathers/"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-831794-b00018",
      "text": "There was a lot of social media interest on Mastodon as users rushed to mock the mix-up. Just a couple of examples:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 18,
      "body_start": 1978,
      "body_end": 2093,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-831794-b00019",
      "text": "> Post by @Jinjirrie@mastodon.social",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 19,
      "body_start": 2095,
      "body_end": 2131,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-831794-b00020",
      "text": "> View on Mastodon",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 20,
      "body_start": 2133,
      "body_end": 2151,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-831794-b00021",
      "text": "> Post by @Snowshadow@mastodon.social",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 21,
      "body_start": 2153,
      "body_end": 2190,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-831794-b00022",
      "text": "> View on Mastodon",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 22,
      "body_start": 2192,
      "body_end": 2210,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-831794-b00023",
      "text": "While Trump's tariffs caused chaos to the US and global economy, penguins were going wild on TikTok. Chelsea Gabrielle posted a crowd-pleaser:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 23,
      "body_start": 2212,
      "body_end": 2354,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-831794-b00024",
      "text": "> @chelseagabriella0",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 24,
      "body_start": 2356,
      "body_end": 2376,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.tiktok.com/@chelseagabriella0?refer=embed"
      ],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-831794-b00025",
      "text": "> Damn no one is safe from the tariffs put on them #penguins #tariffs #heardisland #comedy#trending #penguin #foryoupage",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 25,
      "body_start": 2378,
      "body_end": 2498,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.tiktok.com/tag/comedy?refer=embed",
        "https://www.tiktok.com/tag/foryoupage?refer=embed",
        "https://www.tiktok.com/tag/heardisland?refer=embed",
        "https://www.tiktok.com/tag/penguin?refer=embed",
        "https://www.tiktok.com/tag/penguins?refer=embed",
        "https://www.tiktok.com/tag/tariffs?refer=embed",
        "https://www.tiktok.com/tag/trending?refer=embed"
      ],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-831794-b00026",
      "text": "> ♬ Gangsta's Paradise (feat. L.V.) – Coolio",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 26,
      "body_start": 2500,
      "body_end": 2544,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.tiktok.com/music/Gangsta's-Paradise-feat-LV-6704956234862168065?refer=embed"
      ],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-831794-b00027",
      "text": "With Russia not on the tariffs list, even Rolling Stone couldn't resist the headline: “Trump Launches Trade War With Penguins, Not Putin”:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 27,
      "body_start": 2546,
      "body_end": 2684,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.rollingstone.com/politics/politics-news/trump-tariffs-trade-war-global-penguins-not-putin-1235309637/"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-831794-b00028",
      "text": "> Trump is placing tariffs on countries around the globe — including even remote Antarctic islands inhabited only by penguins — while exempting the Russian regime of Vladimir Putin.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 28,
      "body_start": 2686,
      "body_end": 2867,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-831794-b00029",
      "text": "Even Chuck Schumer, US Senate Democratic leader, got in on the act on Threads:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 29,
      "body_start": 2869,
      "body_end": 2947,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.threads.net/@senschumer/post/DH_eS41RrMo"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-831794-b00030",
      "text": "> Donald Trump slapped tariffs on penguins and not on Putin.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 30,
      "body_start": 2949,
      "body_end": 3009,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-831794-b00031",
      "text": "Anyway, despite the jabs, Trump's tariffs are no joke:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 31,
      "body_start": 3011,
      "body_end": 3065,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-831794-b00032",
      "text": "> The fact this isn't an April Fools spoof is just wild. He tariffed penguins.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 32,
      "body_start": 3067,
      "body_end": 3145,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-831794-b00033",
      "text": "> — StrawberryVotes (@verymerryberry.bsky.social) April 4, 2025 at 9:42 AM",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 33,
      "body_start": 3147,
      "body_end": 3221,
      "source_links": [
        "https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:wgkn2jgp5s6gt3zj6jzvgy7x/post/3llwxyudhpc2g?ref_src=embed",
        "https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:wgkn2jgp5s6gt3zj6jzvgy7x?ref_src=embed"
      ],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    }
  ],
  "body_sha256": "266ce1bf35a2fe6098188870e5df728e666cddcb88609a32e6953d739617ef26",
